:"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":true,"topics":["bitbucket","cicd","devops","docker-registry-v2","git","git-gui","git-server","gitea","github","github-actions","gitlab","go","golang","hacktoberfest","maven-server","npm-registry","vue"],"visibility":"public","forks":6255,"open_issues":2890,"watchers":52486,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/pulls/23028","html_url":"https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/23028","diff_url":"https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/23028.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/23028.patch","merged_at":"2023-02-21T06:12:57Z"},"body":"Close  #23027\r\n\r\n`git commit` message option _only_ supports 4 formats (well, only ....):\r\n* `\"commit\", \"-m\", msg`\r\n* `\"commit\", \"-m{msg}\"`  (no space)\r\n* `\"commit\", \"--message\", msg`\r\n* `\"commit\", \"--message={msg}\"`\r\n\r\nThe long format with `=` is the best choice, and it's documented in `man git-commit`:\r\n\r\n`-m <msg>, --message=<msg> ...`\r\n\r\nps: I would suggest always use long format option for git command, as much as possible.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/23028/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/23028/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/comments/1437792449","html_url":"https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/issues/23027#issuecomment-1437792449","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/23027","id":1437792449,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBFIx285VsvjB","user":{"login":"wxiaoguang","id":2114189,"node_id":"MDQ6VXN